+// Code Red: the PokÉEG, in the game (owner, 2026-10-09). From the PC: every Pokémon the player
+// owns (party, then the boxes), and for the one under the cursor a look inside its mind.
+// The game knows the Pokémon; the page knows the mind (readers, hot memory, code history live in the
+// cloud save). So this screen asks the page through a mailbox, one Pokémon at a time, and draws what
+// comes back. Hot memory is typed on the page (a note can be 200 characters; the naming screen can't).
+// No host → the mind lines stay blank; the screen still works as a list.
+#include "global.h"
+#include "gflib.h"
+#include "data.h"
